      "content": "<h3>All TreeMap methods at a glance</h3>\n<p><em>n</em> is the number of entries.</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;\">\n<tr><th style=\"text-align:left;\">Method</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">What it does</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">Time</th></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>put, get, remove, containsKey, getOrDefault, putIfAbsent, replace, merge, compute...</strong></td><td>The ordinary Map methods</td><td>O(log n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>containsValue(v)</strong></td><td>Scans all entries</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>firstKey()</strong> / <strong>lastKey()</strong></td><td>Smallest / largest key (throws if empty)</td><td>O(log n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>firstEntry()</strong> / <strong>lastEntry()</strong></td><td>Smallest / largest entry (null if empty)</td><td>O(log n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>pollFirstEntry()</strong> / <strong>pollLastEntry()</strong></td><td>Remove and return smallest / largest entry</td><td>O(log n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>lowerKey / floorKey / ceilingKey / higherKey</strong></td><td>Neighbour key below or above a value</td><td>O(log n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>lowerEntry / floorEntry / ceilingEntry / higherEntry</strong></td><td>The same, returning the whole entry</td><td>O(log n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>headMap(to)</strong> / <strong>tailMap(from)</strong> / <strong>subMap(a, b)</strong></td><td>Range views</td><td>O(log n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>descendingMap()</strong> / <strong>descendingKeySet()</strong> / <strong>navigableKeySet()</strong></td><td>Reverse / key set views</td><td>O(1)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>keySet() / values() / entrySet() / forEach()</strong></td><td>Views and loops in key order</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>comparator()</strong></td><td>The ordering in use (null = natural)</td><td>O(1)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>clone / equals / toString</strong></td><td>Copy and compare</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n</table>"
